NN LAN Launcher V0.9.63 — Test Build
This build lets Play launch games that require administrator permission. Windows will show a UAC prompt; approve it to start the game.

Download LAN Launcher V0.9.63.zip from Assets and extract the entire folder. Keep Host.exe, Client.exe, Quick Start.exe, and Launcher Bin together. Use V0.9.63 on both the Host and Client PCs.

This is a test build. The packaged Host and Client passed startup checks, but launching an administrator-required game through the Windows UAC prompt still needs a live test. The launcher executables are unsigned, so Windows or antivirus software may show a warning.

The automatically generated “Source code” ZIP is not the playable launcher. Download the attached LAN Launcher V0.9.63.zip instead.
